1%20483.3%2031.1%20448V128zM111.1%20208V432C111.1%20440.8%20119.2%20448%20127.1%20448C136.8%20448%20143.1%20440.8%20143.1%20432V208C143.1%20199.2%20136.8%20192%20127.1%20192C119.2%20192%20111.1%20199.2%20111.1%20208zM207.1%20208V432C207.1%20440.8%20215.2%20448%20223.1%20448C232.8%20448%20240%20440.8%20240%20432V208C240%20199.2%20232.8%20192%20223.1%20192C215.2%20192%20207.1%20199.2%20207.1%20208zM304%20208V432C304%20440.8%20311.2%20448%20320%20448C328.8%20448%20336%20440.8%20336%20432V208C336%20199.2%20328.8%20192%20320%20192C311.2%20192%20304%20199.2%20304%20208z'/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt="Trash-can"></button></td></tr></tbody></table><form class="form-radio-ext" id="no-print3"><h2>Severidad</h2><div class="btn-package severity-c"><label class="btn-inside yellow" for="Leve"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="severity" id="Leve" value="Leve" checked="">Leve</label><label class="btn-inside orange" for="Moderado"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="severity" id="Moderado" value="Moderado">Moderado</label><label class="btn-inside black" for="Grave"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="severity" id="Grave" value="Grave">Grave</label><label class="btn-inside filtro-auto" for="mostrar-automaticas"><input type="checkbox" id="mostrar-automaticas" checked="">Observaciones automáticas</label></div><div class="wrap-label copyDesc-btn">Copiar descripciones para SIRTO<img class="reset-img" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20448%20512'%3e%3c!--!%20Font%20Awesome%20Pro%206.4.2%20by%20@fontawesome%20-%20https://fontawesome.com%20License%20-%20https://fontawesome.com/license%20(Commercial%20License)%20Copyright%202023%20Fonticons,%20Inc.%20--%3e%3cpath%20d='M384%20336H192c-8.8%200-16-7.2-16-16V64c0-8.8%207.2-16%2016-16l140.1%200L400%20115.9V320c0%208.8-7.2%2016-16%2016zM192%20384H384c35.3%200%2064-28.7%2064-64V115.9c0-12.7-5.1-24.9-14.1-33.9L366.1%2014.1c-9-9-21.2-14.1-33.9-14.1H192c-35.3%200-64%2028.7-64%2064V320c0%2035.3%2028.7%2064%2064%2064zM64%20128c-35.3%200-64%2028.7-64%2064V448c0%2035.3%2028.7%2064%2064%2064H256c35.3%200%2064-28.7%2064-64V416H272v32c0%208.8-7.2%2016-16%2016H64c-8.8%200-16-7.2-16-16V192c0-8.8%207.2-16%2016-16H96V128H64z'/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt="copy description"></div><button type="button" class="regenerar-btn" id="regenerar-btn">Regenerar observaciones automáticas</button><label class="filtro-frases" for="filtrar-frases-automaticas"><input type="checkbox" id="filtrar-frases-automaticas" checked="">Filtrar frases automáticas<small> (en Grupo, Sección y Descripción no aparecen las frases que la app ya agrega sola)</small></label><div class="variable-btn"><div class="btn-package col-class group-c"><h3>Grupo</h3><label class="focus" for="acumDefectos"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="group" id="acumDefectos" value="acumDefectos">Acumulación de defectos</label><label class="focus" for="direccion"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="group" id="direccion" value="direccion">Dirección</label><label class="focus" for="freno"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="group" id="freno" value="freno">Frenos</label><label class="focus" for="inspVisual"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="group" id="inspVisual" value="inspVisual">Inspección Visual</label><label class="focus" for="inspFosa"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="group" id="inspFosa" value="inspFosa">Inspección en Fosa</label><label class="focus" for="luces"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="group" id="luces" value="luces">Luces</label><label class="focus" for="ruedas"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="group" id="ruedas" value="ruedas">Ruedas</label><label class="focus" for="sistemaElectrico"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="group" id="sistemaElectrico" value="sistemaElectrico">Sistema Eléctrico</label><label class="focus" for="suspension"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="group" id="suspension" value="suspension">Suspensión</label><label class="focus" for="note"><input type="radio" name="group" id="note" class="rad-c" value="note"><b>*Notas adicionales</b></label></div><div class="btn-package col-class section-c"><h3>Sección</h3></div><div class="btn-package col-class description-c"><h3>Descripción</h3></div></div><h2 class="unlisted-defect"> Defecto no listado</h2><div class="unlisted-ctn"><label for="unlisted-defect" class="unlisted-defect">Seleccióne grupo al que pertenece la falla, luego el seleccione la opción "Otros" y finalmente escriba el defecto:</label><textarea name="unlisted-defect" id="unlisted-defect" class="unlisted-defect" cols="50" rows="3"></textarea><button class="send-btn">Agregar a la lista</button></div></form><table class="references print"><thead><tr class="reference-headers"></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="def-name minor">Leve</td><td class="def-col">Son defectos que no exigen una nueva inspección, pero que deberán subsanarse antes de la siguiente revisión.</td></tr><tr><td class="def-name orange">Moderado</td><td class="def-col">Exigen una nueva inspección sin cargo dentro de los sesenta (60) días corridos a partir de la verificación. Pasando el tiempo estipulado de “circulación originaria”, repetirá el pago original.<br><b>(*) Si el vencimiento coincide con domingo o feriado, el mismo se traslada al día habil inmediato anterior.</b></td></tr><tr><td class="def-name black"><b>Grave</b></td><td class="def-col">Exigen una nueva inspección atento a la gravedad que registra la unidad. Repetirá el pago original. Esta calificación no permite la circulación del vehículo. Una vez reparada la unidad se someterá a la segunda inspección.</td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr></tr></tfoot></table></section></section></main></div>"`;

exports[`pantalla inicial > sin archivo cargado (snapshot) 1`] = `"<div><header><h1>Informes Bubatec</h1></header><main><form class="form-radio" id="no-print"><main></main><div id="reset-btn" class="wrap-label reset-btn" for="reset-btn">Reiniciar todos los campos:<img class="reset-img" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20512%20512'%20fill='%23FFFFFF'%3e%3c!--!%20Font%20Awesome%20Pro%206.1.2%20by%20@fontawesome%20-%20https://fontawesome.com%20License%20-%20https://fontawesome.com/license%20(Commercial%20License)%20Copyright%202022%20Fonticons,%20Inc.%20--%3e%3cpath%20d='M480%20256c0%20123.4-100.5%20223.9-223.9%20223.9c-48.86%200-95.19-15.58-134.2-44.86c-14.14-10.59-17-30.66-6.391-44.81c10.61-14.09%2030.69-16.97%2044.8-6.375c27.84%2020.91%2061%2031.94%2095.89%2031.94C344.3%20415.8%20416%20344.1%20416%20256s-71.67-159.8-159.8-159.8C205.9%2096.22%20158.6%20120.3%20128.6%20160H192c17.67%200%2032%2014.31%2032%2032S209.7%20224%20192%20224H48c-17.67%200-32-14.31-32-32V48c0-17.69%2014.33-32%2032-32s32%2014.31%2032%2032v70.23C122.1%2064.58%20186.1%2032.11%20256.1%2032.11C379.5%2032.11%20480%20132.6%20480%20256z'/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt="reset"></div><h2>Tipo de vehículo</h2><div class="btn-package"><label class="btn-inside radio-checked" for="Auto"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="tipo" id="Auto" value="Auto" checked="">Auto</label><label class="btn-inside " for="Camioneta"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="tipo" id="Camioneta" value="Camioneta">Camioneta</label><label class="btn-inside " for="Camion"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="tipo" id="Camion" value="Camion">Camión</label><label class="btn-inside " for="Minibus"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="tipo" id="Minibus" value="Minibus">Colectivo</label><label class="btn-inside " for="Moto"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="tipo" id="Moto" value="Moto">Moto</label><div class="engine-and-size-ctn"><div class="engine-and-size"><label class="btn-inside transp-color" for="normal"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="rtoType" id="normal" value="normal" checked="">Normal</label></div><div class="engine-and-size"><label class="btn-inside transp-color" for="traPas"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="rtoType" id="traPas" value="traPas">Transporte de Pasajeros</label></div></div><div class="engine-and-size-ctn"><div class="engine-and-size"><label class="btn-inside" for="4x2"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="transmisionType" id="4x2" value="4x2" checked="">Normal</label></div><div class="engine-and-size"><label class="btn-inside" for="4x4"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="transmisionType" id="4x4" value="4x4">Integral (ignora resistencia de F.)</label></div></div></div><h3>Calcular fecha</h3><div class="btn-package"><label class="btn-inside Apto" for="Apto"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dateCalcBtn" id="Apto" value="Apto" checked="">Apto</label><label class="btn-inside Condicional" for="Condicional"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dateCalcBtn" id="Condicional" value="Condicional">Condicional</label><label class="btn-inside Rechazado" for="Rechazado"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dateCalcBtn" id="Rechazado" value="Rechazado">Rechazado</label><label class="btn-inside SoloInforme" for="SoloInforme"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dateCalcBtn" id="SoloInforme" value="SoloInforme">Solo informe</label><label class="btn-inside resultado-auto" for="resultado-automatico" title="Con algún defecto Grave: Rechazado. Con alguno Moderado: Condicional. Si no: Apto."><input type="checkbox" id="resultado-automatico" checked="">Automático</label> <span>Vigencia:</span><label class="focus btn-inside tooltip" for="2a"><span class="tooltiptext">7 Años o menos</span><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dueDateSelector" id="2a" value="2a">2 A</label><label class="radio-checked btn-inside tooltip" for="1a"><span class="tooltiptext">APTO</span><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dueDateSelector" id="1a" value="1a" checked="">1 A</label><label class="focus btn-inside tooltip" for="6m"><span class="tooltiptext">Plataforma digital</span><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dueDateSelector" id="6m" value="6m">6 M</label></div><h3>Carga de archivos e impresión</h3></form><section class="finalReport"><div class="insert-btn-cont" id="no-print2"><div class="btn-txt-render-container"><label for="file-input" id="file-input-label" class="wrap-label">Seleccione archivo txt a procesar:<img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20384%20512'%3e%3c!--!%20Font%20Awesome%20Pro%206.1.1%20by%20@fontawesome%20-%20https://fontawesome.com%20License%20-%20https://fontawesome.com/license%20(Commercial%20License)%20Copyright%202022%20Fonticons,%20Inc.%20--%3e%3cpath%20d='M256%200v128h128L256%200zM224%20128L224%200H48C21.49%200%200%2021.49%200%2048v416C0%20490.5%2021.49%20512%2048%20512h288c26.51%200%2048-21.49%2048-48V160h-127.1C238.3%20160%20224%20145.7%20224%20128zM288.1%20344.1C284.3%20349.7%20278.2%20352%20272%20352s-12.28-2.344-16.97-7.031L216%20305.9V408c0%2013.25-10.75%2024-24%2024s-24-10.75-24-24V305.9l-39.03%2039.03c-9.375%209.375-24.56%209.375-33.94%200s-9.375-24.56%200-33.94l80-80c9.375-9.375%2024.56-9.375%2033.94%200l80%2080C298.3%20320.4%20298.3%20335.6%20288.1%20344.1z'/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt="upload file" class="upload-btn-img"><input class="btn-input" type="file" id="file-input" name="file-input" accept="text/plain"></label></div><div class="btn-txt-render-container"><label for="image_uploads" class="wrap-label">Seleccione la foto del vehículo:<img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20384%20512'%3e%3c!--!%20Font%20Awesome%20Pro%206.1.1%20by%20@fontawesome%20-%20https://fontawesome.com%20License%20-%20https://fontawesome.com/license%20(Commercial%20License)%20Copyright%202022%20Fonticons,%20Inc.%20--%3e%3cpath%20d='M224%20128L224%200H48C21.49%200%200%2021.49