ass="btn-inside transp-color" for="normal"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="rtoType" id="normal" value="normal" checked="">Normal</label></div><div class="engine-and-size"><label class="btn-inside transp-color" for="traPas"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="rtoType" id="traPas" value="traPas">Transporte de Pasajeros</label></div></div><div class="engine-and-size-ctn"><div class="engine-and-size"><label class="btn-inside" for="4T"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="engineType" id="4T" value="4T" checked="">Motor 4 tiempos</label></div><div class="engine-and-size"><label class="btn-inside" for="2T"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="engineType" id="2T" value="2T">Motor 2 tiempos</label></div></div></div><h3>Calcular fecha</h3><div class="btn-package"><label class="btn-inside Apto" for="Apto"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dateCalcBtn" id="Apto" value="Apto" checked="">Apto</label><label class="btn-inside Condicional" for="Condicional"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dateCalcBtn" id="Condicional" value="Condicional">Condicional</label><label class="btn-inside Rechazado" for="Rechazado"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dateCalcBtn" id="Rechazado" value="Rechazado">Rechazado</label><label class="btn-inside SoloInforme" for="SoloInforme"><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dateCalcBtn" id="SoloInforme" value="SoloInforme">Solo informe</label><label class="btn-inside resultado-auto" for="resultado-automatico" title="Con algún defecto Grave: Rechazado. Con alguno Moderado: Condicional. Si no: Apto."><input type="checkbox" id="resultado-automatico" checked="">Automático</label> <span>Vigencia:</span><label class="focus btn-inside tooltip" for="2a"><span class="tooltiptext">7 Años o menos</span><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dueDateSelector" id="2a" value="2a">2 A</label><label class="radio-checked btn-inside tooltip" for="1a"><span class="tooltiptext">APTO</span><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dueDateSelector" id="1a" value="1a" checked="">1 A</label><label class="focus btn-inside tooltip" for="6m"><span class="tooltiptext">Plataforma digital</span><input type="radio" class="rad-c" name="dueDateSelector" id="6m" value="6m">6 M</label></div><h3>Carga de archivos e impresión</h3></form><section class="finalReport"><div class="insert-btn-cont" id="no-print2"><div class="btn-txt-render-container"><label for="file-input" id="file-input-label" class="wrap-label">Seleccione archivo txt a procesar:<img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20384%20512'%3e%3c!--!%20Font%20Awesome%20Pro%206.1.1%20by%20@fontawesome%20-%20https://fontawesome.com%20License%20-%20https://fontawesome.com/license%20(Commercial%20License)%20Copyright%202022%20Fonticons,%20Inc.%20--%3e%3cpath%20d='M256%200v128h128L256%200zM224%20128L224%200H48C21.49%200%200%2021.49%200%2048v416C0%20490.5%2021.49%20512%2048%20512h288c26.51%200%2048-21.49%2048-48V160h-127.1C238.3%20160%20224%20145.7%20224%20128zM288.1%20344.1C284.3%20349.7%20278.2%20352%20272%20352s-12.28-2.344-16.97-7.031L216%20305.9V408c0%2013.25-10.75%2024-24%2024s-24-10.75-24-24V305.9l-39.03%2039.03c-9.375%209.375-24.56%209.375-33.94%200s-9.375-24.56%200-33.94l80-80c9.375-9.375%2024.56-9.375%2033.94%200l80%2080C298.3%20320.4%20298.3%20335.6%20288.1%20344.1z'/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt="upload file" class="upload-btn-img"><input class="btn-input" type="file" id="file-input" name="file-input" accept="text/plain"></label></div><div class="btn-txt-render-container"><label for="image_uploads" class="wrap-label">Seleccione la foto del vehículo:<img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20384%20512'%3e%3c!--!%20Font%20Awesome%20Pro%206.1.1%20by%20@fontawesome%20-%20https://fontawesome.com%20License%20-%20https://fontawesome.com/license%20(Commercial%20License)%20Copyright%202022%20Fonticons,%20Inc.%20--%3e%3cpath%20d='M224%20128L224%200H48C21.49%200%200%2021.49%200%2048v416